        "body": "This release contains an important installer bug fix for anyone who does not get GLPK and/or SCIP installed properly, and makes usage of the COBRA-k package release 0.0.13 (https://github.com/klamt-lab/COBRA-k/releases/tag/v0.0.13) with an improved performance for thermodynamic calculations, as well as fixing reactions with negative upper bounds (issue #577) thanks to @PyLaRi24.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Version 1.2.11 by @Paulocracy in https://github.com/cnapy-org/CNApy/pull/578\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cnapy-org/CNApy/compare/v1.2.10...v1.2.11",
